snippet.description:
The demo version of Brofish — a roguelike autobattler with tower defense elements has been released!

Steam game page: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4210140/Brofish/

Here’s what awaits you:
- Catch and level up crazy fish that tear enemies to pieces on their own;
- Evolve identical fish into even more powerful creatures;
- Broken synergies between fish, food, and items;
- Five biomes, elite enemies, bosses, and an endless mode;
- Short but intense runs where every step could be your last.

Grab your fishing rod and set out to hold back the hordes of the undead. Assemble squads of killer fish, create the most overpowered builds, and save the village from the Sea King.

